      "text": "The cheapest supplier can become your most expensive decision.\n\nFreight. Customs. Storage. Delays. Quality issues.\n\nThe supplier’s price is only one part of the cost.\n\nSmart procurement looks beyond the quotation to the total cost of getting the right product, at the right",
