      "text": "3 questions to ask any freight forwarder:\n1. Dedicated sensitive channel or mixed with general cargo?\n2. Who covers customs storage if inspected?\n3. Do you pre-check MSDS &amp; HS codes?\nWe do all 3. DDP to US/EU.\nDM \"QUOTE\" + product.\n#FreightForwarding #CustomsCompliance https://t.co/cauVsEW4yf",
