      "text": "2/5\nThe four charges that show up at destination:\n- THC (terminal handling)\n- Documentation\n- Chassis and demurrage\n- Customs exam, if you get pulled\n\nNone of these are a surprise to a forwarder. They are only a surprise to you.",
